       rdma_get_request - Retrieves the next pending connection request event.

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       ##iinncclluuddee <<rrddmmaa//rrddmmaa__ccmmaa..hh>>

       iinntt  rrddmmaa__ggeett__rreeqquueesstt  ((ssttrruucctt  rrddmmaa__ccmm__iidd  **_l_i_s_t_e_n,,  ssttrruucctt rrddmmaa__ccmm__iidd
